    "   `worktrees integrate` recovery (step 3); do not re-run checks per\n"
    "   slice otherwise. After the LAST builder of the wave has integrated\n"
    "   and every slice is retired (in a fault-only pass: after the last\n"
    "   fault fix), run the repository's whole-tree verification ONCE on\n"
