    "   `gate: PASS @<full HEAD sha>`, `gate: FAIL @<full HEAD sha>` or\n"
    "   `gate: skipped (no product change since <gate_sha>)`. No other Lead\n"
    "   verification: no per-slice re-review, no open-ended self-review.\n"
